WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
Hellooo!

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.020
Hi! How's it goin'?

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.780
I finally got it! I got the 10-million subscriber plaque! WOOOOO

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.760
I think it's pretty much just because Felix made a big stink about his,

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:15.460
But I got it as collateral damage, which is just as good as anything about getting it out of pure merit.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:16.740
But it's really cool.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.260
And it's... REALLY heavy.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.620
And this probably shouldn't have been the first thought when I got it,

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.600
But I... I imagined how easy it would be to beat someone to death with it,

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.380
Which probably reveals something very bad about my personality.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.300
BUT I GOT IT!                              YEAH!

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.680
And it's so cool!

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.200
I know... I... I shouldn't say that cliché so much,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.880
But it's really, really awesome.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.500
And I only have you guys to thank for it, and I actually don't know what I'm gonna do with it.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:46.260
Because I'm not one for awards, I'm not one for collectibles, I'm not one for uh... keepsakes and stuff like that.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.360
But this is special!

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.520
Because it- it represents, like, how far... we have come as a community and it represents,

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:55.180
You know, how much WE have accomplished.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.760
And, I think...

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:59.980
As testament to how much I appreciate this award,

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:02.820
I'm going to be walking around the entirety of VidCon

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.060
WITH this, IN my arms,

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.580
*Giggling* Much like when I got the Taco Trophy that was given to me by Ra-

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:09.380
I'm gonna go get it!

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:09.940
Hang on!

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:16.620
Much like this Taco Trophy that has been by my bedside since I got it!

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.560
Some of you noticed that in the background of my videos,

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:25.060
Uh, yeah, I keep it by my bed because I'm so proud of what I've done to win this Taco Trophy,

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:26.720
And this is just as cool!

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:29.780
Maybe even cooler, I don't know, they're kind of 50/50 on the coolness scale.

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:34.100
But, I'm gonna be carrying this around with me at VidCon, which is just in a few days.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.160
Also JackSepticEye is currently in town,

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.040
And, uh, we're gonna be doing a lot of cool stuff.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:42.460
Follow us on social media so you can see all the stupid pictures that we're gonna take!

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.040
And stuff.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:47.860
So we're all gonna be at VidCon and we're gonna be having a great time. And I don't want you guys to worry,

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:52.200
Because this year there's going to be, uh, much higher security- while we're there

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.580
Obviously in relation to what we talked about on the last vlog.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:55.920
But I don't want you guys to worry at all.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:56.960
We're still gonna meet,

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:58.780
Everything's still gonna be fun,

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:02.220
Uh, we're gonna be there, like, we- Me, Jack, you know, all my friends...

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:03.400
We go there...

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.840
To meet you guys.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.700
And we don't want anything to get in the way of that.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.100
And things might be a little bit different this year,

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.540
But that doesn't mean that we're gonna meet any less of you guys.

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:16.200
I go there- not to network, not to socialize, not to hang out, not to go to parties,

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.440
I go there to meet you guys.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:19.260
And I'm gonna be carrying this around with me!

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:23.000
I just won't be able to go on the public floor with it.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.320
So, look for me!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:25.860
If you find me, say hi!

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:29.500
But I don't know if I'll be able to go around and just walk around wherever I want.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.040
But it's still gonna be a good time,

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.960
And then after that, uh, next month-

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.040
I am going to Comic-Con.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:38.720
Which should be- if you met me last year at Comic-Con, you noticed that it was a little bit crazy.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:43.400
There were a lot of people, and then Comic-Con got angry because we were blockin' up the hallways.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:48.600
Actually, the Marvel booth got angry because we were blocking up THEIR-

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.500
Like their big whatever-the-heck they were advertising.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:56.680
But it should be a lot better-organized this year, we're gonna be selling posters that I'll gladly sign for you guys.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.760
And if you don't know, these are the poster covers!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.700
They're there-ish and things!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:06.040
And if you didn't know these are the cover art for the upcoming Markiplier comic,

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.260
Which is still available- I think?

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:13.400
I think if you order... in the next, like, week you can still get the July version.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:16.680
But they're coming out like July, August, whatever the next month is.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:20.920
Don't question my ability to count months. I know what months come after August- do- that- nyeh

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:24.580
