00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:32.040
So if you want that, uh, check the link in the description below, you can still get it.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:32.540
So,

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.440
*High-pitched screech*

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:37.180
So in other news, while Jack is in town we should be making a lot of collaborative videos.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:39.960
And also we're gonna be working on the Ninja Sex Party shoot.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.660
And ALSO, at the end of this week,

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.840
Uh, Night 4 of the Five Nights at Freddy's musical with Random Encounters will be coming out.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:53.000
Uh, I'll let you guys know about that, but just keep an eye out. I think it's gonna be on their channel on Friday.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.020
I'll put links in Facebook and Twitter and wherever I can to get to it.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.940
But thank you guys so much for supporting that effort

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:02.260
and thank you guys so much for supporting us in making videos.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:05.600
I think Jack might've gotten this also, so...

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.720
