00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:13.660
I'm gonna talk him into both of us carrying this around SO proud.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:20.020
And if he doesn't have it, then I'M gonna carry it around and GLOAT about how much better I am than him!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.880
Because I also have a Taco Trophy.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:27.080
So... thank you guys so much for watching. I can't wait to meet you guys at VidCon,

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:30.520
I can't wait to meet you guys at Comic-Con, it's gonna be a lot of fun,

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.520
And we're gonna do some cool stuff while we're there.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:37.120
